      "title": {
        "en": "Independent Scenario Analysis: lower high",
        "zh": "独立情境分析：确认看跌序列中的更低高点与更低低点"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Analyse both a valid and an invalid interpretation of confirming lower highs and lower lows in bearish sequences using the assigned chart. Compare the evidence, explain the risk boundary, identify what would change your conclusion and state when no trade is preferable.",
